{"id":"u-9ca35ac0-2d51-46df-bfb9-a546c9742b4e","src":"community","title":"Roman Foundation 2.0","author":"Mace Starwalk","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/K5EahM-roman-foundation","desc":"This full body program is meant for the complete beginner with no previous gym experience.\n\nI designed this program with my 16 year old brother in mind, making sure to avoid heavy lifts and certain isolation exercises, to protect his tendons and growth plates.\n\nUntrained/weak tendons are extremely easy to tear or snap, so I have made sure to avoid certain isolation exercises where this is a particularly high risk, and have selected other excellent that are good for safely building tendon strength.\n\nAs he is still growing, this means his bone-growth-plates have not fully fused together. I have made sure to avoid particularly heavy lifts that risk damaging the infused growth plates and stunting his growth, allowing him to grow muscle and strengthen bones and tendons without compromising long term bone growth.\n\nWorkouts are 3 days a week and can be completed within 30 minutes. The main focus is building the foundational muscle and tendon strength required to safely perform more advanced workouts in the future, without any long-term sacrifices to growth or health.\n\nSome conditioning has also been included, for general wellbeing and metabolic health.\n\nRest periods between sets should be 60 seconds unless stated otherwise.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Bodyweight Fitness","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":30,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-07-21T20:58:00.472Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push A","Pull A","Legs A"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":0,"rpe":8,"x":2},{"r":0,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Tricep Kickback","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]}]},{"ex":